@page "/docs/odysseus"
@layout PublicDocsLayout
<PageTitle>Odysseus · ARKANA GATEWAY</PageTitle>
<header class="docs-page-header"><div><span class="docs-kicker">Panduan Workspace · Odysseus</span><h1>Odysseus</h1><p>Odysseus adalah self-hosted AI workspace untuk chat, Agent, research, documents, dan local model workflows.</p></div><span class="docs-agent-mark"><Heroicon Name="server" Size="28" /></span></header>
<section class="docs-prose-section"><h2>Status integrasi</h2><p><span class="badge">Conditional</span> Odysseus mendukung model lokal dan API model, tetapi direct ARKANA GATEWAY configuration harus diverifikasi pada deployment dan UI version yang digunakan.</p></section>
<section class="docs-prose-section"><h2>Nilai yang diperlukan</h2><div class="docs-definition-list"><div><dt>Base URL</dt><dd><code>https://gateway.arkana.dev/v1</code></dd></div><div><dt>Model</dt><dd><code>gpt-5.5</code> jika tersedia untuk key</dd></div><div><dt>Authentication</dt><dd>Secret store atau environment variable</dd></div><div><dt>Protocol</dt><dd>OpenAI-compatible, jika Provider custom tersedia</dd></div></div></section>
<section class="docs-prose-section"><h2>Setup</h2><ol class="docs-list"><li>Deploy Odysseus sesuai setup resmi dan pastikan authentication tetap aktif.</li><li>Buka provider/model settings.</li><li>Jika Custom OpenAI-compatible Provider tersedia, masukkan Base URL dan model.</li><li>Simpan API key melalui Secret mechanism.</li><li>Uji text, Tool event, artifact, dan Gateway Logs.</li></ol></section>
<section class="docs-callout"><Heroicon Name="arrow-top-right-on-square" Size="21" /><div><strong>Referensi resmi Odysseus</strong><p><a href="https://github.com/odysseus-dev/odysseus">Repository</a> · <a href="https://github.com/odysseus-dev/odysseus/blob/dev/docs/setup.md">Setup guide</a></p></div></section>
